# ============================================================================
#  MyProject - Git ignore rules (Unreal Engine 5.8 project)
#  Created in Phase 2 of the controlled development setup.
#  Rule: NEVER ignore Config/, Content/, Scripts/ or *.uproject
# ============================================================================

# ---- Unreal generated / machine local (never commit) ----------------------
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Build/

# ---- IDE / editor ---------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sln
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.user
*.userprefs
*.code-workspace

# ---- Build / debug leftovers ---------------------------------------------
*.target
*.pdb
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.autosave

# ---- Operating system ----------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ============================================================================
#  Deliberately NOT ignored (kept under version control):
#    Config/                        -> Default*.ini project settings
#    Content/                       -> all assets
#    Content/__ExternalActors__/    -> World Partition external actor data
#    Content/__ExternalObjects__/   -> World Partition external object data
#    Scripts/                       -> editor automation scripts
#    MyProject.uproject             -> project descriptor
# ============================================================================
